{
  "id": "p19",
  "title": "The Night Garden by the Railway",
  "titleZh": "铁路边的夜花园",
  "topic": "邻里与社区园艺",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My neighbour and I began a quiet project beside the railway.",
        "zh": "我和邻居在铁路旁开始了一个安静的项目。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some neighbours laughed, but many others came to help.",
        "zh": "有些邻居笑了，但更多人跑来帮忙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We had twenty pounds and a bag of sand.",
        "zh": "我们有二十英镑和一袋沙子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A foreigner from the next street brought his own spade.",
        "zh": "隔壁街的一位外国人带了自己的铁锹。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plan was simple: lay plants on bare ground at night.",
        "zh": "计划很简单：趁夜把花苗铺在光秃秃的地上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then everybody painted a small sign and set to work.",
        "zh": "然后每个人画了个小牌子，动手干起来。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My mother doubted us, and her doubt was serious.",
        "zh": "母亲怀疑我们，她的怀疑是认真的。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She said the company would never allow it, and she was right.",
        "zh": "她说铁路公司绝不会允许，她说得对。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A church group read about us and sent old tools.",
        "zh": "一个教会小组读到我们的事，送来了旧工具。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Their parent group gave us tea and hot soup at night.",
        "zh": "他们的家长团在夜里给我们送来茶和热汤。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The news spread among the poor streets near the tracks.",
        "zh": "消息在铁路边的穷街上传开了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "People said the same thing: the strip looked sad.",
        "zh": "人们说着同样的话：那条空地看起来真可怜。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My class chose the site, and a student led the research.",
        "zh": "我们班选定了这块地，一名学生负责研究。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her study showed the soil was basic, and we were able to test it.",
        "zh": "她的研究表明土壤偏碱，而我们有能力去检测。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The report hit a nerve, and the national paper ran it.",
        "zh": "报告触动了人心，国家级报纸也刊登了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The response was strange, and the surprise was a crowd.",
        "zh": "反应很奇怪，而惊喜的是来了一群人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the weather turned, and rain filled a shallow pool.",
        "zh": "后来天气变了，雨水积成一个浅水潭。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We were glad of it, and so was every nervous neighbour.",
        "zh": "我们为此高兴，每个紧张的邻居也一样。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A white wing flashed above our guerrilla garden at dawn.",
        "zh": "黎明时，一只白翅膀掠过我们的游击花园。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Anybody could follow the path, and the sight was odd.",
        "zh": "任何人都能顺着小路找来，那景象有点怪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I told myself the fun was worth it, but words could not express it.",
        "zh": "我告诉自己这份乐趣值得，但言语表达不出来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then shareholders sent free soil and a supply of seeds.",
        "zh": "后来股东们送来了免费土壤和一批种子。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It arrived by truck, and we laid it down with care.",
        "zh": "东西用卡车运到，我们小心地铺开。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Our intention was simple, and our success made us very proud.",
        "zh": "我们的意图很简单，成功让我们非常自豪。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The till at the market stall gave us our last pound that night.",
        "zh": "那天晚上，市场摊位的收银盒给了我们最后一英镑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A wise neighbour said the wealth of a street is a green heart.",
        "zh": "一位睿智的邻居说，一条街的财富是一颗绿色的心。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Whatever grows there now, we ourselves still weed it every month.",
        "zh": "如今无论那里长出什么，我们自己仍每月去除草。"
      }
    ]
  ],
